nvestigators in the case against Iran  which continues to deny any involvement  this morning the commander of Iran's  Revolutionary Guard warned that while  Iran doesn't want a war with anyone it's  ready for one in the midst of all this  regional tension president Trump is due  to meet with Russian President Vladimir  Putin next week at the g20 summit you  can bet that Iran will be high up on  that agenda  Anthony Charlie d'Agata in the United  Arab Emirates thanks charlie
 

